  "limits": [
    "This integrates authenticated preflight materials and plan preparation on the host; actual Android JAR verification, system signing facts and installation still need device evidence.",
    "The signed report authenticates the APK publisher assertion and exact APK bytes; it remains an offline preflight with installation_authorized/device_state_verified/storage_compatibility_verified=false. It does not supply user approval, storage compatibility or update health.",
    "Only RSA/ECDSA signed JARs with one CodeSigner and a bounded certificate path are accepted. The leaf is pinned to the current single, nonrotated APK signer; imported chains do not create a CA trust policy.",
    "Original artifact files must be retained or reselected for new effects. Unknown commit queries remain readable without the files and never resubmit.",
    "Product import/persistence, visible permission review and source/system-confirmation recovery, actual installation and complete identity/grant/journal/key health acceptance remain unfinished. installed_unverified remains blocking."
  ]
